# No Cursor Attribution

When creating git commits for this project:

- Do NOT add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any Cursor-related trailer to commit messages.
- Do NOT add "Made with Cursor", "Generated by Cursor", or similar attribution to code, README, or documentation.
- Commit author should remain the user only.
